{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "built_at": "2026-10-14T09:42:21.111850+00:00",
  "manifest_sha256": "a02181bc95469bf409c91fe60c40f1c742a1974c6d94673a84115bb266eeb95a",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "source_id": "LEAVE-001",
      "regulation_id": "LEAVE",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/LEAVE/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "d85342972968ba9ed04bd682de9b7cb6d06c6922ee0744a054370a7413fbd8e4",
      "chunk_sha256": "2742b64270b033899a0014aff88accf85751ec381b381f71959b993b32fe8614",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "b28dccd423ab33250e54d3c794dea4e782cbf347",
      "text": "## LEAVE-001 一般事假\n\n原則上提前一個工作天申請。如已知請假需求，建議提前三個工作天通知。緊急事故應在情況允許時儘速通知。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "LEAVE-002",
      "regulation_id": "LEAVE",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/LEAVE/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "d85342972968ba9ed04bd682de9b7cb6d06c6922ee0744a054370a7413fbd8e4",
      "chunk_sha256": "dae8b8b9c7bd786f05afbe595d1ec8dd41b61a4cc4c17f50e2fb2ceb9791659d",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "b28dccd423ab33250e54d3c794dea4e782cbf347",
      "text": "## LEAVE-002 請假流程\n\n員工透過 HRM 系統提出申請。依不同假別進行主管審核或確認。HR 負責行政確認及紀錄。不得將所有假別視為主管可以任意拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "LEAVE-003",
      "regulation_id": "LEAVE",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/LEAVE/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "d85342972968ba9ed04bd682de9b7cb6d06c6922ee0744a054370a7413fbd8e4",
      "chunk_sha256": "408ee2ac45ce56f2e3bac36b4b671d2d34af042b2904637796fa9988439aac3d",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "b28dccd423ab33250e54d3c794dea4e782cbf347",
      "text": "## LEAVE-003 病假\n\n突發疾病應儘速通知主管。相關證明原則上於請假日起三個工作天內補交。證明可以包含診斷證明書、就醫收據、藥單等。特殊情況可向主管或 HR 說明。不得僅因逾期就直接否定依法享有的請假權利。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "LEAVE-004",
      "regulation_id": "LEAVE",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/LEAVE/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "d85342972968ba9ed04bd682de9b7cb6d06c6922ee0744a054370a7413fbd8e4",
      "chunk_sha256": "4ec11d2e137529d2b4c0eea3f9576f5b5d789bcfda4c2255b634761700d7a632",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "b28dccd423ab33250e54d3c794dea4e782cbf347",
      "text": "## LEAVE-004 特休\n\n依台灣適用勞動法令辦理。特休日期原則上由勞工排定。建議提前三個工作天通知主管，但非強制期限。企業若有急迫經營需求，須依法協商調整。不得將一般事假的主管核准規則直接套用特休。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "LEAVE-005",
      "regulation_id": "LEAVE",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/LEAVE/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "d85342972968ba9ed04bd682de9b7cb6d06c6922ee0744a054370a7413fbd8e4",
      "chunk_sha256": "888934976e82df3bd6ac311ef068d1af4c46e0a2656570f43d310ab58ce59a49",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "b28dccd423ab33250e54d3c794dea4e782cbf347",
      "text": "## LEAVE-005 緊急請假\n\n可先通知主管，再依實際情況補登 HRM。相關流程仍須符合適用法令。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ATT-001",
      "regulation_id": "ATT",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ATT/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "080b8a00a471328f8e1b00c060d175bb0ee12bba910b16f791b0b2e1dfafcd93",
      "chunk_sha256": "2ed7085be51350544ecc50312c8c105cc088671d75bede81f57906f1d38613e7",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "1cf58a0927b3141ff23a959c4d6ef7a901af8f73",
      "text": "## ATT-001 固定工作時間\n\n星期一至星期五，上午 09:00 至下午 18:00。午休 12:00 至 13:00。每日正常工作時間八小時。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ATT-002",
      "regulation_id": "ATT",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ATT/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "080b8a00a471328f8e1b00c060d175bb0ee12bba910b16f791b0b2e1dfafcd93",
      "chunk_sha256": "c31cb2d310604e0674b0d54154ead9480dcf1cd9786c0655b36ac6da494cd2b4",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "1cf58a0927b3141ff23a959c4d6ef7a901af8f73",
      "text": "## ATT-002 忘記打卡\n\n員工應於發現漏打卡後，原則上三個工作天內提出補登申請。由主管確認實際出勤，再由 HR 更正。不得僅因逾期就抹除員工實際工作時間。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ATT-003",
      "regulation_id": "ATT",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ATT/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "080b8a00a471328f8e1b00c060d175bb0ee12bba910b16f791b0b2e1dfafcd93",
      "chunk_sha256": "d98ecd0698c2997e0a6571fee21a746d4db66004b360cbe0d7f5e3d33589eafe",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "1cf58a0927b3141ff23a959c4d6ef7a901af8f73",
      "text": "## ATT-003 遲到\n\n發現可能遲到時，應在安全且可行的情況下，儘速通知直屬主管。突發事件可事後說明。不得自行新增「一定要提前三十分鐘通知」的要求。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ATT-004",
      "regulation_id": "ATT",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ATT/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "080b8a00a471328f8e1b00c060d175bb0ee12bba910b16f791b0b2e1dfafcd93",
      "chunk_sha256": "d29ec67ac0eab443e52b01b2bff251c433a6ed0c88ff20fefc0ab00478d4cec9",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "1cf58a0927b3141ff23a959c4d6ef7a901af8f73",
      "text": "## ATT-004 加班\n\n不強制員工事前提交加班申請單。應依實際提供勞務的情況及出勤紀錄判斷。延後打卡不必然代表加班。加班費與補休依法律及適用約定辦理。不得將未事前申請直接作為拒付依法應付加班費的理由。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-001",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "2db62b0139ff42e3f61abf02b8db36ded58d9417e0f174e22b0cb409037dad9f",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-001 設備異常\n\n電腦、螢幕及其他資訊設備故障時，向 IT 部門通報。若影響工作進度，同時通知主管。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-002",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "28a7b1d367f35da0ff9f96367ec28b3ef592c61c5674887da647e50a65dd5f8b",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-002 維修與更換\n\nIT 負責檢查與評估。必要時評估維修、更換或提供備用設備。不得保證一定有備用設備。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-003",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "5b79c9a565868555208aecd1f822cf711bfcf2d12c1def73803f9ed38dbe7dc1",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-003 設備使用限制\n\n未經 IT 授權，不得自行拆卸、修理、送交外部維修或安裝未經核准的軟體。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-004",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "f27f3b3b52b6b59bf74014df9a26a439b147e8551b5f04d6e988eb228903726c",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-004 額外設備申請\n\n員工提出設備需求及使用理由。經直屬主管簽核同意後，由 IT 評估設備庫存、適用性及配置可行性。主管同意不代表設備一定可以提供。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-005",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "48064a9fec7c3cc136ff70cae6e800f4559f3decc1f815246975c3e40048d092",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-005 設備損壞\n\n由 IT 確認技術狀況。正常耗損原則上由公司處理。涉及人為損壞時，須依法釐清責任。不得直接認定員工必須全額賠償。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IT-006",
      "regulation_id": "IT",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/IT/1.2.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "71b1a05cf503689608496c3e90b5a8b4eb07db3dc65aaa2ae873b710f6f235a9",
      "chunk_sha256": "dc4aa78f4f9c28b807a171fb752982e345c10d06df62d8665abce4d80a7f8123",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "cdf06602e124fc77d6db83d214454f88aba99a23",
      "text": "## IT-006 設備攜出管理規範\n\n1. 公司設備採授權管理制度，已取得攜出授權的個人設備，可於授權範圍內攜出，無須每次重新申請。\n2. 敏感設備係指儲存、處理或可存取公司機密、個人資料、客戶資料，或具有高權限系統存取能力，且經 IT 依實際資訊安全風險認定需要額外保護與攜出管理的設備。\n3. 敏感設備由 IT 部門負責認定，必要時由指定資安人員協助評估。\n4. 敏感設備首次申請攜出時，須經直屬主管同意及 IT 評估核准。\n5. 因經常性出差、遠距工作或其他業務需求，員工得申請一定期間或範圍的持續攜出授權。\n6. 已取得持續授權者，在核准範圍內無須逐次申請；超出授權範圍時，須重新申請。\n7. 敏感設備應依 IT 指定的資訊安全措施使用與保管。\n8. 共用設備仍須依設備借用及登記規範辦理。\n9. 未經授權，不得將公司設備交由其他人員使用。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-001",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "2818518340a0737d00fe5e6fd6d8b74cf0f702f16fa18f14db80c0b0418ed8e0",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-001 帳號與密碼\n\n優先使用核准的密碼重設方式。無法處理時向 IT 求助。不得共用帳號及密碼。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-002",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "9dca5e8bb21ae314b7f1f7476c57f925fd27da63f3c6443495fb2fba1a8e10a5",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-002 釣魚郵件\n\n不要點擊可疑連結或附件。發現異常時應立即通報 IT 或指定資安人員。若已點擊連結或輸入帳密，也應立即通報。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-003",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "56b7dc75fe06270be1f16037e5d1e429873bee99da6b5677a1f4b34b543a4713",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-003 私人 USB\n\n原則上不得使用私人 USB 儲存或傳輸公司內部資料。特殊工作需求須經 IT 授權。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-004",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "cbd040d062af180ab5448103d0f188aa90e821d60bdaf3f815e7571962329953",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-004 生成式 AI 使用\n\n僅能使用公司核准的工具。不得任意將個資、客戶資料、內部機密或其他未獲授權資料輸入外部 AI。使用者應自行確認 AI 輸出結果。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-005",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "cc007b5806784660fae15486440f520246bfa40a0a5230a24f0c4eaaa6021f4e",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-005 系統存取權限\n\n員工向主管提出業務需求。主管確認後，由 IT 評估並設定最小必要權限。不得共用帳號或使用未授權權限。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SEC-006",
      "regulation_id": "SEC",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/SEC/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "b55d64f5728fa5d536d656fdb1e593a1b041a1fe196d4775e3e157aab2127dff",
      "chunk_sha256": "0568c2af1999cf1861bea9ba75a58d90107488ed9b29bdfd67c277ca2953a75f",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "7340d806fef65103b47b8fdd837f2bca9edf6085",
      "text": "## SEC-006 資料誤寄或外洩\n\n立即通報 IT 或指定資安人員。提供事件時間、收件對象及涉及資料等必要資訊。後續由授權人員評估及處理。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-001",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "48a9e5d02332e059d978a58fbd3d2c00ea8d74158b37becdc7f9eb6f399e5885",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-001 薪資發放\n\n每月五日發放前一個月份薪資。遇非銀行營業日，提前至前一銀行營業日。由員工提供本人帳戶。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-002",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "28e885162ecdacc77ee72654b88e1aec37794bde3731d08fe3eff177377e9d04",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-002 薪資異常\n\n聯繫 HR 薪酬承辦人員。必要時由財務部門協助。應依相關法令適時處理薪資差額。不得擅自認定只能等下個月補發。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-003",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "316d509f0911ab4e503322f28e4bd67dac6a7ae86515a8de1140d6b6e0919875",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-003 薪資帳戶變更\n\n由員工本人提出申請。HR 驗證身分及帳戶資料。每月申請截止日尚未訂定。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-004",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "fb34c919d8d61b10bf8c722727a8120495ace588901ea87218ba8c21ea9054f4",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-004 員工福利\n\n一般福利原則上自到職日起適用。包含生日禮及員工活動等模擬福利。特定補助與金額依各別規定。不得自行編造補助額度。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-005",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "5eb27c6c33f4fcd0eed8be414ad814839f53c81772dc0e9d5b679c401a2c00b3",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-005 HRM 系統\n\n員工可以查看本人相關資料及申請假單。主管可依授權查看及處理部屬資料。HR 可依職務權限管理相關紀錄。不同角色須遵守存取權限限制。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "HR-006",
      "regulation_id": "HR",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/HR/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "85b8561fe02174dab02dd375c8d2c85defe251d80ef62e95442701d1134121bd",
      "chunk_sha256": "4b111e6af4a7e829c05b7b35a99025bc032619541ee061c925c5c5678594ec42",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "5738f8e4884daf21a24c4f7ff94175568dd6eae4",
      "text": "## HR-006 年度獎金\n\n模擬企業設定固定保障一個月年終獎金。新進員工原則上依該年度實際任職期間比例計算。試用期員工不當然排除。另設浮動績效獎金，但不保證金額。詳細例外與離職情況尚未訂定。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ADMIN-001",
      "regulation_id": "ADMIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ADMIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "641b3114c449e262f82a2990e10fd2d18939f3536583d4fef5e768284b59cc9f",
      "chunk_sha256": "5b52c7c4ae025cfe0cb91cb19e35bdf6aafb6dfcb16be13c4defdd9c563dec77",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "77a6667fa0e5b45fed93cb25d038f6f4391a60aa",
      "text": "## ADMIN-001 工作證遺失\n\n立即通報行政部門。必要時停用門禁權限。依身分確認程序補發。補發費用及期限尚未訂定。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ADMIN-002",
      "regulation_id": "ADMIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ADMIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "641b3114c449e262f82a2990e10fd2d18939f3536583d4fef5e768284b59cc9f",
      "chunk_sha256": "cdd0a3895115d01c2d6447d7e03788c5cb86e9d5e337b5d932fac3965b67d4af",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "77a6667fa0e5b45fed93cb25d038f6f4391a60aa",
      "text": "## ADMIN-002 辦公用品\n\n一般文具可直接向行政部門申請領用。特殊或非庫存用品須先由主管確認需求。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ADMIN-003",
      "regulation_id": "ADMIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ADMIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "641b3114c449e262f82a2990e10fd2d18939f3536583d4fef5e768284b59cc9f",
      "chunk_sha256": "0ee69aa9851c0d5e7989b9f7294cb90a6df1612fb6c7f47519d623d52d2d8f95",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "77a6667fa0e5b45fed93cb25d038f6f4391a60aa",
      "text": "## ADMIN-003 辦公環境\n\n冷氣、照明、辦公桌椅等問題，向行政部門通報。不得自行處理可能涉及安全風險的維修。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ADMIN-004",
      "regulation_id": "ADMIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ADMIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "641b3114c449e262f82a2990e10fd2d18939f3536583d4fef5e768284b59cc9f",
      "chunk_sha256": "52d3669eb3b4c2f24133006e2d2838274b885b7d8bfcce16fb5cc9fc781e9b45",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "77a6667fa0e5b45fed93cb25d038f6f4391a60aa",
      "text": "## ADMIN-004 訪客管理\n\n外部訪客進入非公開辦公區前須依規定登記。接待員工應事先通知行政部門。訪客進入非公開區域原則上須有公司人員陪同。管制區域不得未經授權進入。離場時須完成登記及歸還訪客證。訪客資料應依個資規範管理。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "ADMIN-005",
      "regulation_id": "ADMIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/ADMIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "641b3114c449e262f82a2990e10fd2d18939f3536583d4fef5e768284b59cc9f",
      "chunk_sha256": "ed6267892117df28500b42063f2eb478e9267819f65f2da47424d3c3e7a0be84",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "77a6667fa0e5b45fed93cb25d038f6f4391a60aa",
      "text": "## ADMIN-005 會議室\n\n員工可透過內部系統自行預約。一般預約不需主管簽核。取消使用時應儘早取消。資訊設備故障通知 IT。環境設施問題通知行政部門。特殊活動或設備需求可由行政部門協助。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "TRAIN-001",
      "regulation_id": "TRAIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/TRAIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "fde690cd3db3107002487fbc830e7bb410a1f72b3b59f949d2c0d3d2b754ee5a",
      "chunk_sha256": "99a8ffe3314dfdbdf31371528fd3f4c57c49184b3f8bd2ce100aee27db766d3d",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "40d2016ab87c793b328d5c8ea30e378a999843fe",
      "text": "## TRAIN-001 新進員工訓練\n\n所有新進員工應接受指定教育訓練。共同課程包含公司制度與基本資訊安全。其他課程依所屬部門及職務安排。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "TRAIN-002",
      "regulation_id": "TRAIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/TRAIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "fde690cd3db3107002487fbc830e7bb410a1f72b3b59f949d2c0d3d2b754ee5a",
      "chunk_sha256": "bf6b419fa245c632f07176a94f912baf0e532e0eb89789312256e2164ce87979",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "40d2016ab87c793b328d5c8ea30e378a999843fe",
      "text": "## TRAIN-002 缺席與補課\n\n無法參加時應通知主管或訓練承辦人員。必修課程原則上須補課。可採實體、線上或指定教材方式。補課期限尚未訂定。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "TRAIN-003",
      "regulation_id": "TRAIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/TRAIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "fde690cd3db3107002487fbc830e7bb410a1f72b3b59f949d2c0d3d2b754ee5a",
      "chunk_sha256": "194e312e472ff18bf95e2a1c6142a76e3ab2f53937e7807c203e6d980c47a97a",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "40d2016ab87c793b328d5c8ea30e378a999843fe",
      "text": "## TRAIN-003 外部教育訓練\n\n員工應事前提出申請。由主管確認課程必要性。HR 依資格、需求及預算核定。補助金額尚未訂定。完成後應提供必要完訓證明。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "TRAIN-004",
      "regulation_id": "TRAIN",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "source": "regulations/releases/TRAIN/0.1.0.md",
      "document_sha256": "fde690cd3db3107002487fbc830e7bb410a1f72b3b59f949d2c0d3d2b754ee5a",
      "chunk_sha256": "d5561ce517315f67ee16c2053af4391bd4bee63a83d80831ffcda359f46c61bd",
      "effective_date": "2026-10-14",
      "git_commit": "40d2016ab87c793b328d5c8ea30e378a999843fe",
      "text": "## TRAIN-004 訓練完成紀錄\n\n由 HR 或訓練承辦單位統一管理。員工可透過 HRM 查詢本人紀錄。是否提交心得依課程要求決定。紀錄錯誤可向 HR 申請更正。"
    }
  ]
}
